# Raiding Schemes: "Each noncreature spell you cast has conspire" (CR 702.78a, 604.1). Bot1 casts it on turn 1 (the Lotus's three Red,
# Mox Emerald, Mox Jet), then Goblin Champion, Cacophony Scamp (turn 3) and Fanatical Firebrand (turn 5), all red. The Firebrand is
# a creature spell: asked nothing with two untapped red creatures to tap (! Bot1.Modes). On turn 7 Lightning Bolt is a noncreature
# spell: Bot1 pays conspire by tapping the Champion and the Firebrand (the Scamp is left untapped, and tapping them as a cost is
# no {T} ability, so the Firebrand's summoning sickness is no matter, CR 302.6). The trigger copies the Bolt (CR 707.10), the
# copy given a new target (CR 707.10c): the Bolt hits Bot2, the copy Bot1, each losing 3. The copy is no card.

